      "content": "so you're saying a \"balanced approach\" is the only way. but if you had to grade them, isn't the enforcement-first model essentially a failed strategy? it seems like you're treating the idea of strict border security as just a secondary component to the humanitarian approach, rather than a legitimate primary goal for national interest.",
